      },
      "message": "Add six Cogentic research papers:\n\n- \"Unconditional Integer Factorization in Time L_N[1/3, O(1)]\" (`integer_factorization/`)\n- \"Discrete Logarithms in Finite Fields of Fixed Characteristic in Sub-Quasi-Polynomial Time\" (`discrete_logarithm/`)\n- \"An Exact Polynomial-Time Algorithm for 1/5-Approximate Nash Equilibria in Bimatrix Games\" (`bimatrix_nash_equilibrium/`)\n- \"Unconditional Deterministic Subexponential Integer Factoring and Quadratic Nonresidue Construction\" (`deterministic_factoring_l34/`)\n- \"Breaking the Square-Root Barrier for the Log-Rank Conjecture\" (`logrank_conjecture/`)\n- \"Unconditional Edge Reconstruction of Simple Graphs of Linear Density\" (`edge_reconstruction/`)\n\nThese papers were generated by the Cogentic harness. Lean 4 formalizations of all six proofs will be released in a companion submission.\n\nPiperOrigin-RevId: 1029741429",
